  m_Name: Text_BarnWorker_BarnTalk_Who
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Game::Game.Dialogue.TextDialogueNode
  text: Someone who knows this place well, mind. Knows when Pell counts and when he sleeps, knows where the lamps aren't, and walks past that lock like it's nothing to him. Someone who's here a lot, and that nobody bothers counting.
